{"page":389,"verses":[{"verse_key":"28:29","surah":28,"ayah":29,"ar_uthmani":"۞ فَلَمَّا قَضَىٰ مُوسَى ٱلْأَجَلَ وَسَارَ بِأَهْلِهِۦٓ ءَانَسَ مِن جَانِبِ ٱلطُّورِ نَارًا قَالَ لِأَهْلِهِ ٱمْكُثُوٓا۟ إِنِّىٓ ءَانَسْتُ نَارًا لَّعَلِّىٓ ءَاتِيكُم مِّنْهَا بِخَبَرٍ أَوْ جَذْوَةٍ مِّنَ ٱلنَّارِ لَعَلَّكُمْ تَصْطَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Once Moses had fulfilled the term and was travelling with his family, he caught sight of a fire on the side of the mountain and said to his family, ‘Wait! I have seen a fire. I will bring you news from there, or a burning stick for you to warm yourselves.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ فَلَمَّا","en_gloss":"Then when","transliteration":"falammā","verse_key":"28:29"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قَضَىٰ","en_gloss":"Musa fulfilled","transliteration":"qaḍā","verse_key":"28:29"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مُوسَى","en_gloss":"Musa fulfilled","transliteration":"mūsā","verse_key":"28:29"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْأَجَلَ","en_gloss":"the term","transliteration":"l-ajala","verse_key":"28:29"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَسَارَ","en_gloss":"and was traveling","transliteration":"wasāra","verse_key":"28:29"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِأَهْلِهِۦٓ","en_gloss":"with his family","transliteration":"bi-ahlihi","verse_key":"28:29"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ءَانَسَ","en_gloss":"he saw","transliteration":"ānasa","verse_key":"28:29"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"28:29"},{"pos":9,"ar":"جَانِبِ","en_gloss":"(the) direction","transliteration":"jānibi","verse_key":"28:29"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلطُّورِ","en_gloss":"(of) Mount Tur","transliteration":"l-ṭūri","verse_key":"28:29"},{"pos":11,"ar":"نَارًۭا","en_gloss":"a fire","transliteration":"nāran","verse_key":"28:29"},{"pos":12,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"28:29"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لِأَهْلِهِ","en_gloss":"to his family","transliteration":"li-ahlihi","verse_key":"28:29"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱمْكُثُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"Stay here","transliteration":"um'kuthū","verse_key":"28:29"},{"pos":15,"ar":"إِنّ