g like a snake, he fled in fear and would not return. Again [he was called]: ‘Moses! Draw near! Do not be afraid, for you are one of those who are safe.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَأَنْ","en_gloss":"And [that]","transliteration":"wa-an","verse_key":"28:31"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَلْقِ","en_gloss":"throw","transliteration":"alqi","verse_key":"28:31"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَصَاكَ ۖ","en_gloss":"your staff","transliteration":"ʿaṣāka","verse_key":"28:31"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَلَمَّا","en_gloss":"But when","transliteration":"falammā","verse_key":"28:31"},{"pos":5,"ar":"رَءَاهَا","en_gloss":"he saw it","transliteration":"raāhā","verse_key":"28:31"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تَهْتَزُّ","en_gloss":"moving","transliteration":"tahtazzu","verse_key":"28:31"},{"pos":7,"ar":"كَأَنَّهَا","en_gloss":"as if it","transliteration":"ka-annahā","verse_key":"28:31"},{"pos":8,"ar":"جَآنٌّۭ","en_gloss":"(were) a snake","transliteration":"jānnun","verse_key":"28:31"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَلَّىٰ","en_gloss":"he turned","transliteration":"wallā","verse_key":"28:31"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مُدْبِرًۭا","en_gloss":"(in) flight","transliteration":"mud'biran","verse_key":"28:31"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَلَمْ","en_gloss":"and (did) not","transliteration":"walam","verse_key":"28:31"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يُعَقِّبْ ۚ","en_gloss":"return","transliteration":"yuʿaqqib","verse_key":"28:31"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَـٰمُوسَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"O Musa","transliteration":"yāmūsā","verse_key":"28:31"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَقْبِلْ","en_gloss":"Draw near","transliteration":"aqbil","verse_key":"28:31"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"28:31"},{"pos":16,"ar":"تَخَفْ ۖ","en_gloss":"fear","transliteration":"takhaf","verse_key":"28:31"},{"pos":17,"ar":"إِنَّكَ","en_gloss":"Indeed, you","transliteration":"innaka","verse_key":"28:31"},{"pos":18,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"(are) of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"28:31"},{"pos":19,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔامِنِينَ","en_gloss":"the secure","transliteration":"l-āminīna","verse_key":"28:31"},{"pos":20,"ar":"٣١","en_gloss":"(31)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"28:31"}]},{"verse_key":"28:32","surah":28,"ayah":32,"ar_uthmani":"ٱسْلُكْ يَدَكَ فِى جَيْبِكَ تَخْرُجْ بَيْضَآءَ مِنْ غَيْرِ سُوٓءٍ وَٱضْمُمْ إِلَيْكَ جَنَاحَكَ مِنَ ٱلرَّهْبِ ۖ فَذَٰنِكَ بُرْهَـٰنَانِ مِن رَّبِّكَ إِلَىٰ فِرْعَوْنَ وَمَلَإِي۟هِۦٓ ۚ إِنَّهُمْ كَانُوا۟ قَوْمًا فَـٰسِقِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Put your hand inside your shirt and it will come out white but unharmed- hold your arm close to your side, free from all fear. These shall be two signs from your Lord to Pharaoh and his chiefs; they are truly wicked people.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱسْلُكْ","en_gloss":"Insert","transliteration":"us'luk","verse_key":"28:32"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَدَكَ","en_gloss":"your hand","transliteration":"yadaka","verse_key":"28:32"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"28:32"},{"pos":4,"ar":"جَيْبِكَ","en_gloss":"your bosom","transliteration":"jaybika","verse_key":"28:32"},{"pos":5,"ar":"تَخْرُجْ","en_gloss":"it will come forth","transliteration":"takhruj","verse_key":"28:32"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بَيْضَآءَ","en_gloss":"white","transliteration":"bayḍāa","verse_key":"28:32"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"without","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"28:32"},{"pos":8,"ar":"غَيْرِ","en_gloss":"without","transliteration":"ghayri","verse_key":"28:32"},{"pos":9,"ar":"سُوٓءٍۢ","en_gloss":"any harm","transliteration":"sūin","verse_key":"28:32"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَٱضْمُمْ","en_gloss":"And draw","transliteration":"wa-uḍ'mum","verse_key":"28:32"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِلَيْكَ","en_gloss":"to yourselves","transliteration":"ilayka","verse_key":"28:32"},{"pos":12,"ar":"جَنَاحَكَ","en_gloss":"your hand","transliteration":"janāḥaka","verse_key":"28:32"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"against","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"28:32"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلرَّهْبِ ۖ","en_gloss":"fear","transliteration":"l-rahbi","verse_key":"28:32"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فَذَٰنِكَ","en_gloss":"So these","