","verse_key":"28:34"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٣٤","en_gloss":"(34)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"28:34"}]},{"verse_key":"28:35","surah":28,"ayah":35,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَ سَنَشُدُّ عَضُدَكَ بِأَخِيكَ وَنَجْعَلُ لَكُمَا سُلْطَـٰنًا فَلَا يَصِلُونَ إِلَيْكُمَا ۚ بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَآ أَنتُمَا وَمَنِ ٱتَّبَعَكُمَا ٱلْغَـٰلِبُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God said, ‘We shall strengthen you through your brother; We shall give you both power so that they cannot touch you. With Our signs you, and those who follow you, will triumph.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"28:35"},{"pos":2,"ar":"سَنَشُدُّ","en_gloss":"We will strengthen","transliteration":"sanashuddu","verse_key":"28:35"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَضُدَكَ","en_gloss":"your arm","transliteration":"ʿaḍudaka","verse_key":"28:35"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِأَخِيكَ","en_gloss":"through your brother","transliteration":"bi-akhīka","verse_key":"28:35"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَنَجْعَلُ","en_gloss":"and We will make","transliteration":"wanajʿalu","verse_key":"28:35"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَكُمَا","en_gloss":"for both of you","transliteration":"lakumā","verse_key":"28:35"},{"pos":7,"ar":"سُلْطَـٰنًۭا","en_gloss":"an authority","transliteration":"sul'ṭānan","verse_key":"28:35"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَلَا","en_gloss":"so not","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"28:35"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَصِلُونَ","en_gloss":"they will reach","transliteration":"yaṣilūna","verse_key":"28:35"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِلَيْكُمَا ۚ","en_gloss":"to both of you","transliteration":"ilaykumā","verse_key":"28:35"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَآ","en_gloss":"Through Our Signs","transliteration":"biāyātinā","verse_key":"28:35"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَنتُمَا","en_gloss":"you two","transliteration":"antumā","verse_key":"28:35"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَمَنِ","en_gloss":"and (those) who","transliteration":"wamani","verse_key":"28:35"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱتَّبَعَكُمَا","en_gloss":"follow you","transliteration":"ittabaʿakumā","verse_key":"28:35"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱل